# Source and docs: normalise line endings in the repo, check out native.
*.py    text
*.md    text
*.txt   text
*.yml   text
*.yaml  text

# Data files: never convert. A CSV field can legitimately contain CR inside
# quotes, and autocrlf rewrites it silently -- that is data corruption, not
# formatting. This cost us 104 CR bytes across 57 rows of `text_raw` once
# (methodology 3.5.1 keeps text_raw precisely to preserve the pre-normalised
# form for the obfuscation experiments in 3.7.2).
*.csv   -text
*.tsv   -text
*.json  -text

# Binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
